# Rust build artifacts
target/
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: these are binaries, and Vercel resolves
# dependencies from scratch on every build. Pinning the lockfile keeps a
deploy from picking up a breaking minor of vercel_runtime or a transitive dep.

# CLI state written into the repo when HOME/XDG env is stripped (.local/state/gh/…)
.local/

